# kills: OQA zone highlight occupied; OQA zone full dashed: the hovered zone is .ezone.on although it has notes, a zone at its cap is .full with a Full label
# suite: node --test --test-name-pattern ^OQA.zone.highlight.occupied tests/editor_e2e.test.js
